+# sing-vmess
+
+Some confusing protocol.
+
+### Features
+
+100% compatible with `v2ray-core`.
+
+* Stream length chunk with padding and masking
+* AEAD length chunk with padding
+* Stream chunk
+* AEAD chunk
+* Legacy client
+* AEAD client
+* Legacy server
+* AEAD server
+
+Extra features:
+
+* Mux server
+* XUDP client
+* VLESS client
